+## Daemon dependency-recovery switch
+
+Global daemon config defaults `daemon.auto_retry.enabled` to `true`. It must
+be a boolean when present. Setting it to `false` is an emergency stop for
+health-gated terminal-marker recovery and existing healer terminal re-dispatch
+paths; it does not disable status observation or liveness reconciliation that
+turns a proven-dead working agent into an error marker. See [[modules/daemon]].
