+### Parked dependency recovery
+
+An `ERROR` marker is normally terminal. The daemon may transition a closed,
+health-validated dependency failure back to markerless state only after it has
+staged a normal request for the task's current stage. It never resumes an old
+agent or introduces a checkpoint state. The request re-enters the existing
+stage runner from the beginning; all other terminal failures remain parked for
+manual marker recovery. See [[modules/daemon]] and [[modules/markers]].
